sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer as Buyer
    participant UI as Chat UI (React)
    participant LF as Langflow<br/>API Endpoint
    participant Mem as Memory<br/>(session_id)
    participant Agent as Agent Node<br/>(LLM reasoning)
    participant RAG as Vector Store<br/>Retriever
    participant API as SafeExchange<br/>API (Express.js)
    participant SC as Smart Contract<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant LLM as LLM Service<br/>(GPT-4o / Ollama)

    Buyer->>UI: "Trade #42 của tôi đang ở trạng thái nào?"
    UI->>LF: POST /api/v1/run/{flow_id}<br/>{input, session_id}
    LF->>Mem: Load chat history
    Mem-->>LF: previous turns
    LF->>Agent: query + history

    Agent->>LLM: Phân tích intent + chọn tool
    LLM-->>Agent: intent = get_trade_status<br/>tool = escrow_state_reader

    par Off-chain data
        Agent->>API: GET /trades/42
        API-->>Agent: {status:"FUNDED",<br/>buyer, seller, amount}
    and On-chain data
        Agent->>SC: call trades(42)
        SC-->>Agent: {escrowAmount,<br/>nonceSnapshot, owner}
    end

    Agent->>RAG: search("FUNDED state<br/>explanation")
    RAG-->>Agent: context docs

    Agent->>LLM: Tổng hợp off-chain +<br/>on-chain + docs
    LLM-->>Agent: Câu trả lời NL

    Agent->>Mem: Save turn
    Agent-->>LF: response
    LF-->>UI: {message, sources}
    UI-->>Buyer: "Trade #42 đang FUNDED.<br/>Bạn đã ký quỹ 0.5 ETH.<br/>Chờ Seller chuyển owner..."
